{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is the 21st century! Technology has brought many advances to mankind, 3D holo-video! mobile communication devices! data tapes capable of storing kilobytes of information!!! .... But none greater than the STAR DRIVE! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the captain of Inter-Solar Shuttle No. 83, you will set out across the galaxy in this  exciting new space exploration game, managing your ship and supplies as you seek the resources you need to make the next jump. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inter Solar 83 is a thoughtful and awe inspiring trek through the lonely vastness of space, a combination of stunning full size procedural solar systems, 1980s inspired technology and 8-bit computers and strategic ship / resource management.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2098920?t=1759764679","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2098920/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759764679","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2098920/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759764679","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2098920/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759764679","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Supported","id":53},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2436100,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is the 21st century! Technology has brought many advances to mankind, 3D holo-video! mobile communication devices! data tapes capable of storing kilobytes of information!!! .... But none greater than the STAR DRIVE! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As th